title: "Humpback Song Acoustic Trajectory Matching"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Tkachenko"
    given-names: "Vadym"

abstract: >
  A machine-assisted pipeline for multivariate acoustic trajectory
  construction, quantitative trajectory similarity matching, manual
  validation of recurrent acoustic units, and exploratory sequence
  reconstruction in humpback whale song analysis.

